<00:00:00.098>I <00:00:00.185>am <00:00:00.250>the <00:00:00.326>last <00:00:00.609>one. <00:00:01.163>The <00:00:01.217>third <00:00:01.478>Moon <00:00:01.652>car, <00:00:02.272>on <00:00:02.337>the <00:00:02.413>final <00:00:02.761>Apollo <00:00:03.120>landing, <00:00:03.783>in <00:00:03.826>December <00:00:04.876>1972.

